  "keyFeatures": [
    "Project lifecycle management with states: initiating, in-process, finishing, paused, finalized, cancelled",
    "Client payment tracking (entradas) with contracted amount enforcement",
    "Expense tracking (salidas) with supplier, category, and budget line-item linkage",
    "Budget (presupuesto) creation with cost categories: materials, labor, and additional expenses",
    "Budget-to-project conversion workflow with automatic pricing from utility percentage",
    "Budget vs. actual cost comparison reports",
    "Financial analysis dashboard with profitability indicators, filtered by year/month/quarter",
    "PDF export for project closure reports and budget quotations via ReportLab",
    "Role-based access control with admin and employee roles",
    "Security: Argon2id password hashing, HttpOnly cookies, CSRF protection, brute-force lockout, rate limiting",
    "Dual database support: SQLite for development, PostgreSQL for production",
    "Dark/light/system theme preference per user"
  ],
